<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">Onobasulu (ONN) Onobasulu Translation Team February 2007</book>
  <para style="h">Kolosi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Folohe Kolosi Sesefea Sowi Agele Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolosi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt">Kolosi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Folohe Kolosi Sesefea</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sowi Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kolosi amomo, dauno uleno Esia Hele Wedino ami ufulu. Dauno Kolosimo, Efesa daunodaimo hagoale ufulu. Folo e-su, Kolosi ami sese dobumo degeba ufulualebiyo. Aubale. Folo e aso Efesa ami ligia, ehe inolo noolo misini dabalu molomesi hilibaisi, ili Kolosi amida dafasia, sese maugaba ufulubiyo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Inolo noolohe Kolosi sese idele inolo elawaneba ofolaba labeba solu dobelesia, Folohe sesene asigi ule ufulu kiwigaaba homesisia, sowi ewe ilifea selefia mebailu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sowi selelu ewe eweguba selefe. Keliso E-mo, kegele suniane guni labe. Keliso E-su, nini isoba gasiba dafelagoba dilo inolo labe. Eno no alefasia, nini isoba sagoba ufiyobafale. Aubale. Eno noolohe ninimo Kelisodai hago melesi lubia ano. Kelisofea alefasiasu, Godehe kegele sunia molofia holobagalune, Kelisone dabalu amofea alefasia, Godehe kegele sunia gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyo hamefe. Keliso nine libo usu labene, nini idele inolo hili hagaea adesia, Kelisone mana amosu kuliba maiyo dobu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Folo dibolo ligia, ehe sowi ewe selefia, inolo aidafea mesi, aaluhe sowi amo Kolosi sesefea meyone dibia daalu. Inolo agelemo, e Digikusu. Inolo aganebomo, e Onesimusu. Folohe Filemonofea sowi seleba mesia, e inolo Onesimusu amone sulu wedinale saaba selelu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="COL 1:1-2" />Na <char style="w">Folo</char>. Gode Ene hame alefasia na iminilugulu, <char style="w">Keliso</char> Yesune <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> ulenomo, na lolu. Nadai, nine nelewo <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodidai</char>, anihe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="COL 1:1-2" />
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:1-2">Sowi ewe,<char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> Kolosi dauno alebaibu gili amofea seleba mesu. Keliso Efea alefasia, gilimo, nine asigi ule ufulu nelewodali nanodali alebaibu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="COL 1:1-2" />
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:1-2">Nine Nao Godehe gili kanuluba ofelesia, gine asigine libo esebalo gadaeaba melesi moloyobafe.<verse eid="COL 1:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kolosi ilihe Yesufea seale asigi ule ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:15-16">Efe 1.15-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ani Godedai sulu selesiamo, hilia sunia anihe gili hilisesia, nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Kelisone Enaofea henelo. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Maumo, gili Keliso Yesufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesia</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene idele inolo</char> hamesebasu adaaba yaaloba solumo, ani dubulu. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="COL 1:5-6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:13">Efe 1.13</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:4">1Fid 1.4</ref></char></note>Kelisone dabalu amone awalu sulu nafulu, gili olea holobagasimo, gilihe seale sulu sodo amo dubulu. Aulugulu, Godehe kegele nafulu gineba <char style="w">hebene</char> daiyaba dobu amo, gilihe amone diyone <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasiba</char> alebaibu. Gili hame auba diba ofogofia yasiba labe amofea alefasia, asigi ule ufulu manada, hameselo manada, gine libo usu holobagagaba labe. Helefealu sunia awalu sulu nafulu ewe sobosia, sebe heleleba yaafe. Hilia maugaba gilihe awalu sulu nafulu dofasia, Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> sealebuba duluiya ami, sebe gili aleba ami aubasu helelefe.<verse eid="COL 1:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:12">Kol 4.12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Flm 1.23</ref></char>
    </note>Efafalasehe, gilifea Kelisone dabalu amone awalu sulu nafulu ewene walelune, gili hiliseba samodobu. Efafalase e, ninidai Godene balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe ule labi, nini e koleba hamesebume. Ehe nini sagoba ofelesia, Kelisone dabalu seale molobasu adome. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Gili <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> alefasia hameselo mana waleloba, ehe anifea awaba mesome.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe Kolosi ili kiwigaaba homesine, Folohe Godedai sulu selabasu ado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:16-17">Efe 1.16-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, hilia anihe gili auba mana nafulu molofeba solu dubuluiya amifia, anihe gili hilisesia, Godedai sulu selabiasu miliba alolu. Gilihe Godene hame fadaba asigimesi, ani Efea haalibasu ado. Asubane Noekene amone dawaloloda, asigiloda, gine libo wasigaaba ofelesi, gilihe Ene hame auba fadaba asigiyobafe. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Ausi, gilimo Saminilo hamefeguba kuliba dedaleba ligia, kegele sunia gili molofemo, E henemesisia moloyodolu miliyobafe. Ausi, gili Gode fadaba asigife amone mana sobosia, gili mana nafulu suniane sebe heleleyobafe.<verse eid="COL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:19">Efe 1.19</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:16">3.16</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, anihe gili hilisesia, Godedai sulu selesiamo, Efea eweguba haalisu. “Nao-ooo, Ge kiwigagalu <char style="w">elalelu</char> alefasia, Ga koleba, ili kiwigaaba homa. Higinilu adesi, ili higinilu amo agifia, esebalo hamedofa melesi moloba homa. Aufia, ili kiwi sanefia afelesiale, daabasu melesi moloba homa.” Ani Efea auba haalisu.<verse eid="COL 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:11">Efe 1.11</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 1:18">18</ref></char>
    </note>Godehe gilifea auba melesi moloba ufulu labi, gili henefasia, Naofea henelu sulu selaba melale. Enebamo, kegele nafulune nafulu Ehe Ene idele inolo ineba daiyaba ufulu amo, gilida ua dimesine wi melu. <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> yane usu alebaibu ili amohe, Godefeafia daalo ua diyobafe. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:53">Lug 22.53</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:2">Efe 2.2</ref></char></note>Nini nigiligagalune kiwigagalu sisa ami labi, Godehe nini gasiba dafelagofia obegeba dulu. Auba obegeba difasia, Ehe ninimo, Ene hameselo Faibe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami melesi gadefalu. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efe 1.7</ref></char></note>Ene Faibe amofea alefasia, nini sububa dafelagosia, nine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> sunia <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galilu</char> lolu.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Keliso E ana ligia, kegele suniane yasilo labe</para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 4:4">2Kld 4.4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:18">Yon 1.18</ref></char>
    </note>Nini Gode babiyodolualeso,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.15</char> Hogolilu 15 abia 20 amo, Folo alolu fogo amohe, sese ilihe ewemo gasa olabologuba sodo.</note></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:15">Keliso E Gode waaga ligia, Ene mimisililu labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:15">E olaibo labene,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:15">kegele sunia Godehe mololu amone guni, E koleba labe.<verse eid="COL 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Keliso Efea alefasiasu, Godehe kegele sunia mololu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:16">
    <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenene</char> kegele suniada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:16">helefealune kegele suniada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:16">Efea alefasiasu moloba holobagalu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:16">Kegele nini babiyodolu amoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:16">kegele nini babiyodoluale amoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:16">Efea alefasiasu moloba holobagalu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:16">Amomo, kiwigagaluda sefia alebaibu ili amoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:16">asubane kiwigagafia yasiba adaaba yaalo ili amoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:16">Efea alefasiasu moloba ufulu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:16">Kegele sunia Keliso Efea alefasia moloba ufulu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:16">Aulune, kegele sunia Enesu waalebu.<verse eid="COL 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:1">Yon 1.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:58">8.58</ref></char>
    </note>Kegele sunia aso holobagabale labi, Edale alolu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:17">Aulune, kegele sunia Efea saboba kukuliba waalelu dobu.<verse eid="COL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:22-23">Efe 1.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:23">HD 26.23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:5">MUU 1.5</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Sese">Sesene</char> guni amo, E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:18">Aufia, sesemo, Ene domala.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:18">Sesene miliyolune maumo, Ene E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:18">Daneba yaalu ili amo aleba, Edale degelugulu, E olaibo labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:18">Ausimo, E kegele suniafealomo Saminilo ligia, saminiba ano.<verse eid="COL 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:9">Kol 2.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe, kegele sunia Ene Efea wasigaabu aubamo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:19">Ene faibefeada aubasu wasigafia melesi hamelu.<verse eid="COL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:10">Efe 1.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe, kegele sunia haiba no Edai gisa melesialesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:20">Ehe Ene Faibe molofe amofea alefasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:20">kegele sunia amo Enedai seloalu melesi moloba ufulu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:20">Kegele helefealu iwi waalebuda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:20">kegele hebene lagi waalebuda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:20">Ehe Ene Edai haiba hilise ule melesi moloba ufulu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:20">Kelisone ibi <char style="w">imolane</char> saabia sagalu amofea alefasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:20">Godehe auba mololu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="COL 1:20">Auba mololumo, E heafuba mololu.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <para style="s">Godehe gili muuba kalilu melesi gadefaeyo hamelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 5:10">Lom 5.10</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:12">Efe 2.12</ref></char>
    </note>Amakele gili Godedai hago ligia, mana wolusu moloba alolune, gine asigimo Edai gisa alebailubiyo. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:27">Efe 5.27</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 5:10">Lom 5.10</ref></char></note>Auluso, aga Keliso E inolole domala alefasia olalu amohe, Godehe gili Efea haiba hilise ule melesi moloba ufulu. Ehe auba mololumofea alefasia, gili nugumada male adesia, heleba daaluda male ligia, ene olegia <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekene muuba kalilu</char> melesi gadefaeyo hamelu. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Ausi, gili koleba, gine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulufealomo</char> ikau gelugulu kalugaafia mela. Awalu sulu nafulu dubulu amofea alefasia, gili saabia no balu adabasu alebaibuale. Aubale. Godehe kegele sunia haiba nafulu momoloyobafe amofea <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia</char>, gili yasiba adabasu alebaibu. Aulune, kegele ulenohe gili amofeafia sigiba adosine, nafulumale. Awalu sulu nafulu amo, idele inolo sunia anakiwi sisa alebaibu amofea saaba sigilugulu, gilida dubulu alebaibu. <char style="w">Folo</char> na-mo, sulu nafulu amone dabalu mololo inolo uleno lolu.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Kelisone sese sagoba ofelefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Na-mo, gili sagoba ofelesia, aga naga disu ewene, na henefe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.24</char> Hilisema. Folohe dibolo ligia, sowi ewe Kolosifea seleba mefe.</note> Kelisone wifea alefasia higinilu diyone iminimo, helefealu iwi aso ilililuale dobu. Naga na aga domalafealomo dife amohe, imini amo haisi ililife. Ausiamo, na alefasia Kelisone domalamo sagoba ofelefe. Ene domala amo, <char style="w">sese</char>.<verse eid="COL 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 3:2">Efe 3.2</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 3:7-8">7-8</ref></char>
    </note>Na Godene sulu mana haisi ulenoda afelesiale, gilifea saaba memesine, Ehe na sesene dabalu mololo inolo melesi gadefalu. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:25-26">Lom 16.25-26</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:5">Efe 3.5</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 3:9">9</ref></char></note>Amakele waagifia, Godene daiyalu muguba ufulune, idele inolo mosomu saladegelu sunia amo asigiba duluale. Auluso agamo, Godene mugusilu amo, Edai <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">muuba kalilu alebaibu ili</char> amofea ulufaba holobagalubu. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Godehe ilifea eweguba ulufaba waleyo hiliselu. Mugusilu ewene ele amo, beleme <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elalelugulu</char> dobu. Ele amo, ewe koleba. Keliso E gine libo usu miliyo hamefe. Saminimo, mugusilu ele amo koleba, gili <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolofea</char> muguba ufulubiyo. Auluso, aga gilifeada ulufaba ufulu. Aulugulu, gilida Keliso waagulu elalelu miliyone, <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasiba</char> alebaibu.<verse eid="COL 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Nini dawalofia, inolo ule ulebafea haguguba walesiamo, ninihe Keliso mololu amonesu saaba sulu walesu. Na auba walesiamo, gili ule uleba, Godene olegia heleba daaluda male kalugaaba ufiyofia, walesu. Keliso amofea alefasia, gili muuba kalilu moloba ufulu Godene olegia kalugaeyobafe. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:7">Efe 3.7</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 3:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:13">Fil 4.13</ref></char></note>Hame amosu kuliba abia, na hogololu dabalu waagulu boloba kiwigaaba molobasu labi, Kelisone kiwigagalu nafea melu amohe nafea fefedelu moloba ado.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="s">Inolo noolohe gili gegelosine, asigi ule ufulu kolefia alebaimale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Na koleba, gili sagoba ufiyone, hogololu dabalu waagulu boloba molobasu adomo, gili hilisemesi hamefe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.1</char> Folohe ili sagoba ofelesia, dabalu hogololu mololu amo, e Godedai sulu selabasu ado amo iminife.</note> Gili amosu sagoba ofelesuale. Aubale. Sigidubulu idele inolo Laodisia dauno ami alebaibu ili amoda, aufia idele inolo ne misida bolale ili noolo amoda, na aubasu sagoba ofolaba ado. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Hogololu dabalu na molosumo, gili eweguba melesisia molosu. Gili suniane libo kiwigaaba ofelesia, hamesefia, hilise ule melesisia molosu. Aufia, gili dawalolo fadaba difasia, amone elebe sunia dimesisia, na dabalu auba molosu. Ausimo, gili Godene mugusilu nafuluba fadaba asigiba diyobafe. Mugusilu amone maumo, <char style="w">Keliso</char> labe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.2</char> Ninihe Yesu Keliso fadaba asigisenaga, amo ninihe Godene daiyalumo asigiyobafe. Daiyalu amo ewe. Kelisone ibi alefasia Godehe nini gasiba dafelagoba obegeba dulu.</note> <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:24">1Kld 1.24</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 1:30">30</ref></char></note>Dawalolo nokene suniada, asigi nafuluda, samologulu, Keliso Efea wasigafia muguba dobu.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:18">Lom 16.18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo ulenohe gili hahanoba masega gegelosi, na gilifea sulu auba selesu. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:3">1Kld 5.3</ref></char></note>Ne domalamo, gilidai ligialeso, ne asigimo, gilidai ua labe. Aulune, gili dabalu helegeba molosia, Kelisofea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> kolelu dobuba hilisefia, na henebasu lolu.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini koleba Kelisodai kulifia ligia, miliyolu seale diyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Gilihe Yesu Keliso gine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> melesi dulu labene, gili koleba, E galiba daabasu melale. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:17">Efe 3.17</ref></char></note>Aufia, nini gilifea waleluguba, gilihe i helefea seme daafia ado amoguba, Efea auba yoba melale. Aufia, molo i kau kolelu saabia yoba ado amoguba, gili E saabia auba yoba melale. Aubasu, gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea kiwigaafia, gilihe Godefea henelu sulu saeyone wasigafia galebaisabasu melale.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Gili koleba nafulumale. Inolo ulenohe, masega dawalolu sulu balu walesia, gili koneni amofea kisi, e gine asigi sigiba dibia anosi. Inolo amogulumo, ine enauwadalifea asigilo diaba ado. Aufia, muguli inolo helefealuda anakiwida yasibu amofea, ilihe ine dawalolo dilo. Ili koleba Kelisone asigi kuliba anale.<verse eid="COL 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:14">Yon 1.14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:16">16</ref></char>
    </note>Keliso e inolo labi, kegele sunia Godefea wasigaabu amo Efea wasigafia labe. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:21-22">Efe 1.21-22</ref></char></note>Gili Efea kulifia labi, Ehe gilifeada aubasu wasigaaba ufulu dobu. Keliso E asubane suniane kiwigagalumo sunialu labe. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:29">Lom 2.29</ref></char></note>Gili Efea kulisi, Ehe gine <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelelu</char>. Inolone sonehe bado amaleba gelelu amoale. Aubale. Keliso alefasia, nine amakelelune libo manamo sunia diba dafalilu. Ewe koleba, bado amaleba gelelone mana seale.<verse eid="COL 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 6:4">Lom 6.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gili <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gefeyamo</char>, Godehe gili Kelisodai dana ami baliba ufulu. Aufia, gilihe Gode Kelisoda degeba ifolu amone kiwigagalufea asigi ule ufulu. Aulune, Ehe gilida Kelisodai ua degeba ifolu labe. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1">Efe 2.1</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 2:4-5">4-5</ref></char></note>Gine libo aso bado amaleba geleluale ligia, gilihe wolu mana kuliba abia, heleba daaba alolune, gili daneba yaalubiyo. Auba daneba yaalu dobi, Godehe nine wolu sunia hamasia heesia galisia, Ehe ninifea miliyolu mesia, nini Kelisodai degeba ifoba yaalu. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:14-16">Efe 2.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:24">1Fid 2.24</ref></char></note>Sulu muguli selelu dobumo alefasia, nini godofasia, nine wolu mololumo ulufaba ofelesi, nini amone sulu kiwigagalu sisa alolubiyo. Auluso, Gode alefasia, ninida godoyo sulu amo afelesia, <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ofasia, sulu amo diba dafulu. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Keliso E-mo, imolane amofea alefasia kaamo ligia, Ehe asubane kiwigagaba yasibu amone yobolo kegele sunia diba molaba yaafia, ili amo idele inolo suniane si saabia yuamesine, hafinilu degeba melalu.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini Kelisodai olalugulu, helefealune muguli sulu amone keleba asigimabiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:1-13">Lom 14.1-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, hanodai naiyodai nolofealo amoda, hilia bule gulugululofealo amoda, aube hagaea gulugululofealo amoda, <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> gulugululofealo amoda, gili mana amo mololofealomo, inolo uleno gili osolamesi waagi gadefamabiyo. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 8:5">Hib 8.5</ref></char></note>Maumo, kegele amogulumo, dufia holobagaeyobafe amone mimisililu balu walefeso, seale kegele ninihe Keliso Efea walesi besabe. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Gili nafulumale. Inolo uleno bamabamaba ligia, masega ene meleba helea adesia, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ili amofea gulugulusia, gine asigi sigilosine, nafulumale. Gili elebe diyo ufulu dobumo oloba hadosi, gili nafulumale. Inolo amogulumo, Kelisone asigi kuliba abiale, mofeyosu sulu balu selaba ligia, domadomaba ligia, ene masega udia abulu amone awabasu ado. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:21">Efe 2.21</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:16">4.16</ref></char></note>Inolo amogulu ili amo, Kelisofea kulibale labe. Keliso E guni labe. Guni amofea alefasia, Godehe domala sunia sobomesi gadefalo. Hugulumoda, momada, domalamo nafuluba saboba kukulisi, amo soboba ado.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="COL 2:20-21" />Gilimo Kelisodai olalune, muguli inolo helefealuda, anakiwida, yasibu amone kiwi sisafia gili sububa dafelagolu alebaibu. Auba aulune, gili aga aso muguli inolone molomabiyolu sulu ewe kuliba aafe ogo, mau enebane ause? “Ga semabiyo. Ga gemabiyo. Ga namenabiyo.” Gilihe muguli inolone sulu amogulu aso kuliba dedaleba labegulu, gili aso ine kiwi sisa alebaibuba besabe. Mau enebane ause? Gili sububa dafelagolu alebaibuba hilisema! <verse eid="COL 2:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:9">Mad 15.9</ref></char></note>Molomabiyolu sulu amogulumo, helefealu kegelefealo sodo. Asigilelo kegele amo koleba. Molomabiyolu sulu amoguluda, molomalelu sulu amoguluda, inolofea alefasiasu holobagagalo. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Ee, inolo sulu amogulu kuliba aafe amo, e dawalolu labeba bamesisia aulo. E nafuluba gulugululo inolo labeba bamesisia aulo. Aufia, e helea adefeba bamesisia aulo. Auluso, e seale helea adefale, masega sodo. Aufia, e ene domala nafuluba uluba labeba bamesisia, aulo. Auba auloso, muguli sulu amohe, libo degelo hame amo yalamesine, seale sagoba ofolale.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="s">Nini Kelisodai haiba degeba ifolu lolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 12:36">Mag 12.36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:19">16.19</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:20">Efe 1.20</ref></char>
    </note>Gode alefasia gili <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisodai</char> degeba ifolune, gilihe kegele ana lagi dobu amosu hameba melale. Ana lagimo, Keliso e Saminilo ligia, Godene sone ililibefealo yoba sabe. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:33">Mad 6.33</ref></char></note>Gili gine asigi helefealune kegele amofea ofelesiale, ana lagi dobu kegele amofeasu ufia melale. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Enebamo, gili daneba yaalugulu, gine miliyolumo, Kelisodai muguba ufia ligia, Godedai kulifia labe. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Keliso E-mo, gine miliyolune mau labe. Aulugulu, E ulufaba holobagasimo, gilida <char style="w">elalelu</char> ligia, Edai ulufaba holobagaeyobafe.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninimo, hili hagaea holobagabune, nini eweguba miliyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 6:6">Lom 6.6</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 6:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:19">Efe 4.19</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:3-6">5.3-6</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gili koleba, helefealune mana gine libo dobumo, sunia dufa olamale. Na mana noolo ewegulumone selesu. Susugu manada, nugumalu manada, wolu moloyone asigi degelo manada, aufia kegele wedinale dibaiyeba mesegelo manada. Dibaiyeba mesegelo mana ewe, masega gode amofea gulugululone mana hamagulu. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Mana amo molosimo, Godene kanolo suga saabe.<verse eid="COL 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Amakele, gine miliyolumo ami adone, gili mana amo sunia molobasu ado. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:25-29">Efe 4.25-29</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:4">5.4</ref></char></note>Auluso, aga gili mana wolu ewegulumo, sunia dibia saidafalimale. Gadilo mana amoda, asigi libo kanoloda, asigi libo woba hiliseloda, saaba duduba sododa, aufia sulu nugumalu sodo amoda, saidafalimale.<verse eid="COL 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="COL 3:9-10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.9-10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:22">Efe 4.22</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 4:24-25">24-25</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, gili gine geleba no anogo gegesia, masega sulu samabiyo. Enebamo, gili asigi libo amakelelu sunia huba dafalisia, libo hagaea saligalu labe. Gine libo hagaea amo, Godehe hagagaeaba ofolabasu ado. Gilihe E fadaba dawaloba disia, Ene E waagulu melesisia auba aulo. <verse eid="COL 3:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:28">Gal 3.28</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, nini inolo hili hagaea holobagabune, ninimo sunia ule aiba lolu. <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> mosomuda, me Giligine mosomuda, ili amo nobuba hilisemabiyo. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelelu</char> mosomuda, me <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba geleluale</char> mosomuda, ili amo nobuba hilisemabiyo. Aufia, ilosisa aselo mosomuda, me sidi aselo mosomuda, ili amo nobuba hilisemabiyo. Aufia widale mosomuda, me wida labe mosomuda, ili amoda nobuba hilisemabiyo. Enebamo, Keliso E-su labene, E nini suniane libo usu labe.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini koleba nine geleba seale hameseyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Fid 2.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe gili hamesefia, Ene <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> idele inolo melesisia molobebelelu. Aulune, auba molobebelelu gilimo, mana ewegulumone saligamale.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="COL 3:12" />
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 3:12">Yagunagaloda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 3:12">No anogofea heafuba mololoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 3:12">Gine meleba helea adoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 3:12">Hamedufulu adoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 3:12">Aufia esebalo adoda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 3:12">Mana amone gili saligamale.<verse eid="COL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:2">Efe 4.2</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 4:32">32</ref></char>
    </note>No anogone mana habosiale, waagimasia hameseba melale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 3:13">Aufia, inolo no anogofea hiliselu amo, hamasia heesia galimale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 3:13">
    <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> gilifea hamasia heesia galiluguba, gilida aubasu no anogofea hamasia heesia galimale.<verse eid="COL 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 13:8-10">Lom 13.8-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gilihe mana sunia amone saligafasia, madibu ofologuba, hameselo mana homale.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="COL 3:14">Hameselo mana amohe mana sunia nafuluba saboba fedoba semesine ofolo.<verse eid="COL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 4:7">Fil 4.7</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 12:27">1Kld 12.27</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:4">Efe 4.4</ref></char>
    </note>Gili koleba, Kelisone <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealo mana</char> gine asigine libo usu waagi yasiba melalemale.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="COL 3:15">Enebamo, gili domala ulene haisi haisiba ligia, gili aeaba melesine gadefalu labe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 3:15">Aufia, gili Godedai henelu sulu selabasu melale.<verse eid="COL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:19">Efe 5.19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gili dawalofia, gine geleba haguguba walesiamo, gili Kelisone sulumo gine asigine libo usu wasigaalu melale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 3:16">Auba wasigafia ligia, Godedai heafusia, gasa noolo Gasa Bugo dobu amoda, gulugulusia sodo gasa amoda, olabosia saamale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 3:16">Aufia, gasa noolo Asubane Noekenehe gine asigifea hiliseba ofelefe amoda olabomale.<verse eid="COL 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:31">1Kld 10.31</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:20">Efe 5.20</ref></char>
    </note>Kegele sunia gili molofe amo, sulu selefea amida, dabalu molofea amida, Saminilo Yesu ene wi saabiasu molomale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 3:17">Aufia, Ene wifea alefasia, gilihe Nao Godefea henebasu melale.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelisone mosomu mana eweguba kuliba maiyo dobu</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe 5.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele, gili gine gainodali sisa koleba melale.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="COL 3:18">Mana amo Saminilone si saabiamo isolu koleba.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe 5.25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo, gilihe gine geamonodali seale koleba hamesemale.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="COL 3:19">Gilihe ilifea woba waalemabiyo.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:1">Efe 6.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Faibili, gili koleba, gaodai gaedai sulu selefe sunia kuliba malale.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="COL 3:20">Saminilo Ehe mana amogulumone koleba hamebu.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:4">Efe 6.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Enaodali gilimo, gili koleba, gine faibili haboyodolumo molomabiyo.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="COL 3:21">Enebamo, ili habosia, dabalu nafulu moloyone hame dobumo afolosi.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balu dabalu moloba ofolo ilida, ine biso ilida, mana eweguba kuliba maiyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efe 6.5-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">Balu dabalu moloba ofolo</char> gilimo, gine bisone sulumo sunia koleba kuliba malale. Ine sihe gili sidafia labi, gilihe ilifea hahanoba moloyo hilisefea amisuale. Aubale. Gine biso sidabale labida, gili koleba, ine sulu kuliba daabasu melale. Gili Saminilo sisa lolusia, gilihe ine sulu kuliba malale. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Kegele sunia gili molofe ogo, gili koleba, kiwigaaba molosia molomale. Inolone dabalu na molosuba hilisesialeso, Saminilone dabalu molosuba hilisefia molomale. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Enebamo, gili hilisebu, gili auba molosenaga, Saminilohe gilifea sabe mesiamo, Ene daalo meyobafe. Gili koleba auba hilisema. Gilimo, Kelisone dabalu moloba ofolo faibili labi, Ene E-mo, gine Biso seale labe. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:11">Lom 2.11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:8">Efe 6.8</ref></char></note>Inolo wolu molofemo, ene wolu mololu amone efea sabe diyobafe. Gode E alefasia idele inolo suniane manamo, misi bisigiale, isoba sabelo.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Biso, gili koleba, gine<char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu moloba ofolofea</char> mana nafuluda, mana isoluda, molomale. Enebamo, gili eweguba hilisema. Gilida, gine Bisomo <char style="w">hebene</char> labeba hilisema.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godedai sulu saeyo mana amone kiwigaaba kuliba abia, isoba daaba melale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:18">Efe 6.18</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:6">Fil 4.6</ref></char>
    </note>Gili koleba, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu saeyo</char> manamo afelesiale, fedoba semale. Gili si kolafia ligia, Godefea henefia, Edai sulu selaba melale. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:30">Lom 15.30</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:19">Efe 6.19</ref></char></note>Gili Godedai sulu selesiamo, E ninida sagoba homesine saamale. Inolo noolohe Godene sulu ewe dubiyo habosiane, ilihe na dibolo dafogoba ofeleso. Auluso, ninihe <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> mugusilu ulufaba saaba meyone, E eno sogoba homesine, gili koleba, Godedai sulu saamale. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Nahe mugusilu amo sawaba dafa saeyo dobuguba saamesine, gili na sagoba ofelesia, Godedai sulu saamale.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:15-16">Efe 5.15-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gilihe yau idele inolo aleba ami alebaisiamo, gili koleba, asigi dawalofia, ilifea mana isolusu molomale. Ili amofea mana nafulu auba moloyone fogo adesi, fogo amo balu weaselosi, gili madenefia melale. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:29">Efe 4.29</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:15">1Fid 3.15</ref></char></note>Gili noolofea sulu selesiamo, hilia sunia, ilihe gine aealu sulumo nenalebalu dobaiyeba hilisemesisia saamale. Auba ausenaga, gilihe suniafea sulu nafulusu obegeba saeyodolu dobu.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Digikusudai Onesimusudai Kolosi malesi hilibailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Efe 6.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nahe nine hameselo nelewo Digikusu gili labea hilibaisumo, kegele sunia nafea mololumo, ehe gilifea awaba meyobafe. E ninidai dabalu mololo ule ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> dabalu nafulusu moloba adome.<verse eid="COL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:22">Efe 6.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nahe e gili labea malasumo, mau ewe. Gilihe nini eneba labelaba hilisemesineda, aufia ehe gine libo kiwigaaba homesineda hilibaisume. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Flm 1.10-12</ref></char></note>Onesimusumo, Digikusu galiba malesisia, nahe eda hilibaisume. Onesimusu gili mosomu ulene, nine hameselu nelewo nafulu labe. Aaluhe kegele iwi holobagalumo sunia gilifea awaba meyobafeme.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.9</char> <char style="fq" closed="false">Onesimusu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">e-mo, Filemonone balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe alolu. Sowi Folohe Filemonofea seleba melu amoda bamale. (Filemono 1.10-12 ami bamale.)</char></note><verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elosia, Foloda, ili nooloda, Kolosi ilifea hawiyoba solu</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 12:12">HD 12.12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15.37-39</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13.13</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:11">2Dim 4.11</ref></char>
    </note>Alisidakusu e nadai dibolo dafogolune, ehe gilifea hawiyoba selesome.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 4:10">Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasane</char> enesago, <char style="w" lemma="Maga">Maga</char>, eda gilifea hawiyoba selesome. E gili labea esenaga, gili koleba, sulu na gilifea sabaisia soluguba, e heafuba luba dimale.<verse eid="COL 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Aufia, Yesu, ene wi nomo Yasudusu, eda gilifea hawiyoba selesome.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="COL 4:11" />
  <para style="m" vid="COL 4:11">Ne dabalu ule mololo ili aleba ami, ili osoloa amosu, Yuda mosomu inolo labe. Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone degemesine, nini dabalu ua molosia, ilihe ne libo aeaba ofolome.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23-24">Flm 1.23-24</ref></char>
    </note>Gine damene, Efafalase, Yesu Kelisone dabalu mololo inolo ulenomo e, eda gilifea hawiyoba selesome. Hilia sunia e gili hilisesia, Godedai sulu kiwigaaba selesiamo, gili Godene hame nafuluba fadaba hilisemesi selaba adome. Aufia, gili isolusu ligia, asigi dabagalasiale kiwigaaba melesine, amoda e <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selaba</char> adome. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Na Efafalasene manamo si abulune, gilifea eweguba sealeba selesume. E koleba gili sagoba ofelesia, Godedai sulu selesia, hogololu dabalu mololome. Ehe gili amosu sagoba ofolale. Aubale. Ehe idele inolo Laodisia dauno ami alebaibu ili amoda, Hilelafolisi dauno ami alebaibu ili amoda, sagoba ofolaba adome.<verse eid="COL 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Aufia, nine hameselu damene dogoda <char style="w" lemma="Lugu">Lugu</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.14</char> Dawalolo inolo ili hilisesia, <char style="fq" closed="false">dogoda Lugu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ewehe, Lugu Bugoda, Hilibaisi Daalu Bugoda, selelu amo, e waagabuba hilisebu. </char></note> edai, Demasedai, aaluda gilifea hawiyoba selesome.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Gili koleba, nelewodali Laodisia ami alebaibu ili amofea, na ilifea hawiyoba selesoba saamale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="COL 4:15">Aufia, ido Nimifa efeada, <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo ene moloa gagaiyoba adaaba ado ili amofeada, na hawiyoba selesoba saamale.<verse eid="COL 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Gili sowi ewe alegaba samodofasia, gili koleba, Laodisia sese ilida alegamesine mebaimale. Aufia, sowi selelu na Laodisia ilifea mebailu ogo, gili bedoba disia amoda alegamale. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Flm 1.2</ref></char></note>Aufia, gilihe Alikifusufea eweguba saamale. “Dabalu ga Saminilofea dulu ogo, nafuluba moloba samodoyoba hilisemale.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Na <char style="w">Folo</char>, na ne sonehe <char style="sig">Hawiyo</char>ba seleba ofelesu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.18</char> Folohe sowi selelu amo, ene sone koleba selelale. Aubale. E sulu mofeyo selaba labi, inolo none sone alefasia, sulu e selefe amo selelu. Auluso, aga iwimo, Folo ene sone alefasia, sulu noolo selelu. Ausi, sowi eweda alegafe amohe, eweguba eloba bamesine aulu. Sulu sowi ewene usu selelu dobu amo, Folone asigifeafia selelubiyo. Sulu amo inolo none asigifeafia muluba hiliselosine, ehe ene sone imini auba ufulu. (1 Kolidi 16.21 amida bamale.)</note> Na aso dibolo lolugulu, gili na hiliseba melale.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="COL 4:18">Godene <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char> gilidai miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="4.18" /><verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>